      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "(In reference, this was written after it was discovered there was no easy way to bring up the debug menus on keyboards lacking a tilde key, such as those with smaller form-factors or those that are localized differently)\nThere *really* should be a button to turn on logging (rather than there being launch options) at runtime, a button to open the debug menus, and a button to open the latest log in the system's default text editor. The debug section of the main menu is pretty sparse, so there shouldn't be design issues with addressing this.",
